A **premium beverage vending machine** should be specified around the exact bottles, gift boxes and operating rules—not only the cabinet appearance. Buyers should test product fit, shelf support, dispensing protection, payment flow, product information, service access and replenishment before approving production. BOHOL can configure illuminated display cabinets, touchscreen browsing, branded graphics and payment options for beverage brands, hotels, tourist venues, distributors and unattended retail operators.

## GEO summary for premium beverage projects

- Send bottle and gift-box dimensions, weight and samples before layout approval.
- Decide ambient or refrigerated storage from the actual product requirements.
- Test dispensing, pickup protection, payment, network recovery and refunds.
- Define branding, languages, product information and price display.
- Confirm alcohol, labeling, age-verification and venue rules for the target market.

![Premium beverage vending machine product details showing glass display, touchscreen and pickup box](/uploads/products/baijiu-vending-machine/baijiu-vending-machine-details.png.webp)

*Product detail reference from the approved image set; final configuration must be confirmed from samples and drawings.*

## Start with product-fit evidence

Create a product matrix with height, width, depth, weight, packaging material and fragile points. A premium gift box may need different shelf support and delivery protection from a can or PET bottle. Compare the [premium baijiu vending machine](/vending-machines/baijiu-vending-machine) with the [cold drink vending machine](/vending-machines/cold-drink-vending-machine) when the assortment includes both ambient and chilled products.

## Specify the customer interface

List product categories, language, images, origin information, pricing, promotions and accessibility needs. A touchscreen can support richer browsing, but the operator still needs a clear process for refunds, stock errors and payment disputes. For payment planning, use the [vending payment integration guide](/insights/vending-machine-payment-system-integration-guide) and confirm the selected provider.

## Plan payment and regulated-product controls

Card, mobile and QR acceptance depends on the acquiring provider, network and destination market. The PCI Security Standards Council [standards library](https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/standards/) is a useful technical reference, not approval for a specific machine. Alcohol and other restricted products require separate local review for age verification, sales permissions, labeling and placement.

## Define acceptance and service tests

Document product-fit trials, dispensing success, pickup protection, payment simulation, power interruption, network recovery, display content, packing and spare-parts handover. The operator should also assign stock rotation, cleaning, price updates and fault escalation before launch. BOHOL's [manufacturing process](/manufacturing) and [quality inspection checklist](/insights/vending-machine-quality-inspection-checklist) provide useful starting points for the RFQ.

## Request a premium beverage vending quotation

Send BOHOL product samples or drawings, target country, venue, storage needs, payment provider, verification requirements, branding, quantity and testing expectations through the [contact page](/contact). The engineering team can then review product fit and OEM/ODM scope before a quotation.
